{'symbol': 'RJF', 'date': '2022-04-13 10:33:00', 'title': 'STEWARD PARTNERS GLOBAL ADVISORY APPLAUDS THE 15 ADVISOR PARTNERS ON FORBES BEST-IN-STATE WEALTH ADVISORS LIST', 'text': "RECOGNITION REFLECTS WEALTH MANAGEMENT FIRM'S OUTSTANDING GROWTH AND QUALITY OF ADVISORS WASHINGTON, APRIL 13, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- STEWARD PARTNERS GLOBAL ADVISORY, LLC, AN EMPLOYEE-OWNED, FULL-SERVICE WEALTH MANAGEMENT FIRM ASSOCIATED WITH RAYMOND JAMES FINANCIAL SERVICES, INC. (MEMBER FINRA/SIPC), PROUDLY ANNOUNCES THAT 15 OF ITS ADVISOR PARTNERS HAVE BEEN NAMED TO THE FORBES 2022 LIST OF BEST-IN-STATE WEALTH ADVISORS. THE ANNUAL RANKING SPOTLIGHTS MORE THAN 6,000 ADVISORS WHO ARE RESEARCHED, INTERVIEWED, AND ASSIGNED A RANKING BASED ON AN ALGORITHM OF QUALITATIVE AND QUANTITATIVE CRITERIA."}